<title>USA: Homeside Inc unit sells $250 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Homeside Inc unit sells $250 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from HomeSide Lending Inc, a unit of HomeSide Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER HOMESIDE LENDING INC</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.875 PCT  MATURITY 5/15/2000</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.95   FIRST PAY DATE 11/15 1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 6.893 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD +52 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
